### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = {{loginCookie.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### ============================================================
### TENANTS API
### ============================================================

### Get my tenant (ManagerOrAdmin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/mine
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get tenants by user ID (ManagerOrAdmin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/by-user/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}

### List all tenants (MasterAdminOnly)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get tenant by ID (MasterAdminOnly)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}

### Create a new tenant (MasterAdminOnly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
    "name": "NewTenant",
    "displayName": "New Tenant",
    "description": "A new test tenant"
}

### Update a tenant (MasterAdminOnly)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
    "displayName": "Updated Tenant",
    "description": "Updated description"
}

### Activate a tenant (MasterAdminOnly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/activate
Cookie: {{token}}

### Suspend a tenant (MasterAdminOnly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/suspend
Cookie: {{token}}

### Add user to tenant (MasterAdminOnly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/users
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
    "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
    "role": "Manager"
}
